ries from ghana and  tetsuo's childhood memories to the  espa's kids memories when they used to  be experimented on then the flashbacks  cut to canada who's being thrown into an  entirely new reality as the city is  getting destroyed or as the doctor puts  it rebirth we get to see a sick view of  the city from a higher point of  perspective to then cut to k who is  calling for canada and just when i  presumed he was a goner the writer pulls  yet another twist  and reveals that he's still alive he  thanks kay for calling his name out and  they ride along with kaisuke to a new  tokyo the end i hope you enjoyed the  recap of this film as by far it's one of  the longest we've done and due to the  size of the actual film a number of  events happening at the same time we  tried to keep it short and simple as  much as we could or it wouldn't even be  a recap anymore with that said i really  hope you like and subscribe as we've had  a great time doing this one that's about  it see you in the next one
 

